sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User
    participant CW as ChatWidget (React)
    participant API as Backend AI API
    participant Policy as AIPolicy
    participant VS as HybridVectorStore
    participant Embed as Embedding Service
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant DB as MySQL chat_messages

    User->>CW: Nhap cau hoi
    CW->>API: POST /api/chatbot/message
    Note over API: chatbotLimiter 20 req/60s<br/>optionalAuthenticate<br/>validateRequest Zod

    API->>Policy: 1 validateMessage
    Note over Policy: khong rong, <=500 ky tu<br/>co chu hoac so

    alt Message khong hop le
        Policy-->>API: valid=false
        API-->>CW: 400 Bad Request
    else Message hop le
        Policy->>Policy: 2 expandAbbreviations<br/>3 sections, 50+ patterns
        Policy->>Policy: 3 classifyIntent (6 intent)<br/>isPromptInjection (15 loai, 24 regex)

        alt Guard 1: injection (check TRUOC)
            API->>API: detectLanguage VI/EN
            API->>DB: persistMessages isFallback async
            API-->>CW: Response co dinh VI/EN
        else Guard 2: off_topic
            API->>API: detectLanguage VI/EN
            API->>DB: persistMessages isFallback async
            API-->>CW: Response co dinh VI/EN
        else Pass — tat ca intent khac
            API->>API: 4 Load session history<br/>RAM Map, 10 turns (20 msg)
            API->>API: 5a enrichQueryFromHistory<br/>giai quyet dai tu do/nay/kia/no
            API->>API: 5b strip negation phrases

            par Promise.all
                API->>LLM: rewriteQuery max_tokens=80<br/>timeout=8s, catch->null
            and
                API->>VS: hybridSearch topK=10
                VS->>Embed: embed query type=query
                Note over Embed: Jina v3 primary 1024d<br/>Fallback HF e5-large-instruct<br/>Fallback HF e5-large
                Embed-->>VS: query vector 1024d
                VS->>VS: Cosine + keyword scoring<br/>name x3, text x1<br/>merge + overlap boost +0.05
                VS-->>API: initialResults
            end

            LLM-->>API: rewrittenQuery hoac null

            alt rewrittenQuery != normalizedQuery
                API->>VS: hybridSearch rewrittenQuery topK=10
                VS-->>API: refinedResults (dung neu non-empty)
            end

            alt Khong co ket qua
                API->>VS: Fallback minScore=0 topK=3
                VS-->>API: fallbackResults lowConfidence
            end

            API->>LLM: 6 augmentAndGenerate<br/>Promise.race vs budget timer LLM_TOTAL_TIMEOUT_MS
            Note over LLM: system prompt + catalog cache 5min<br/>temp=0.3 max_tokens=800<br/>timeout=30s/call<br/>response_format json_object<br/>Provider rotation retry

            alt LLM thanh cong
                LLM-->>API: response
                API->>API: parseLLMOutput<br/>exact > version > number > 80% overlap
            else Providers fail hoac vuot ngan sach
                API->>API: simpleKeywordMatch fallback<br/>name+10 desc+5<br/>top-5 text, top-3 cards
            end

            API->>API: 7 Update history Map<br/>TTL 30min, MAX_SESSIONS 500<br/>LRU eviction
            API->>DB: INSERT chat_messages async
            API-->>CW: response products suggestions intent
        end
    end
